    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12066" root="دبل" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَبْلٌ</span></b>  <i>A rivulet,</i> or <i>streamlet:</i> (T, M, Mgh, K:)
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُبُولٌ</span>: (S, M, Mgh, K:) so called because
cleansed, and put into a right, or proper, state
[when needing]. (T, S, M. *) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>Plague,</i> or <i>pestilence;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَاعُونٌ</span>. (Th, M, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا لَهُ دَبَلَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَبْلُهُ</span>: see 1, last sentence but one.

